./duration
./timer

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ Deadline is Tuple

+ nanoseconds U64

────────────────────
+ This
    - after Nanoseconds

= This(monotonic-time-nanoseconds() + after as U64)

────────────────────
+ get has-passed

monotonic-time-nanoseconds() >= nanoseconds

────────────────────
+ get remaining Nanoseconds

if nanoseconds > now then (nanoseconds - now) as Nanoseconds else 0ns

.. now = monotonic-time-nanoseconds()
